  "title": "Carrie's Artichoke and Sun-Dried Tomato Pasta",
  "description": "This sun-dried tomato and artichoke pasta is tossed in a wine-based sauce made with garlic, mushrooms, and olives. Add shrimp or chicken if you like!",
